# Checkout

Use a two-column checkout for short, focused purchase flows. The form keeps required fields visually quiet and marks only exceptions with `(optional)`.

The payment fields below demonstrate layout only. In production, mount provider-hosted fields such as Stripe Elements inside the same section so card data never passes through the application UI.

